[[Heket Tongue]]s are long slimy tongues of a [[Heket]]; they are said to hold universal curative qualities. According to [[Kaya (collector)|Kaya]], they are an ingredient to turn people into toads.

==Acquisition==
* [[Guild Wars Nightfall|Nightfall]]
** [[Kourna]] and [[Vabbi]]
*** [[Beast Sworn Heket]]
*** [[Blood Cowl Heket]]
*** [[Blue Tongue Heket]]
*** [[Stoneaxe Heket]]

''Drop and salvage research is ongoing, and can be found [[Talk:Heket Tongue#Drop research|here]].''

===Farming===
====[[Gandara, the Moon Fortress]]====
2 groups of heket - one just outside [[Pogahn Passage|Pogahn Passage (outpost)]], and the other a short distance away to the east. There are only [[melee]] classes in each group, so are a quick and easy farm, and should present few if any problems for [[Soloing|solo]] farming builds.

====[[Barbarous Shore]]====
There are 6 groups patrolling outside [[Camp Hojanu]]. These groups can sometimes include a Blue Tongue Heket healing the other heket, which can make defeating the group more difficult than farming Gandara above. Farming builds will either need to shutdown the healing, or overcome it with significant damage.  Less experienced players may find it helpful to have 2-3 players farm, in which one player acts as party-defense/healer-shutdown while the other 1-2 concentrate on dealing damage.

